nk-ui/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n- Adds an offline-only DDO evaluation engine that computes `OutcomeRecord`, `AttributionRecord`, and `CounterfactualRecord` from captured `DecisionEvent`/`IncidentRecord` inputs plus an explicit evaluation observation.\n- Replay, hindsight-leakage guards, explicit horizons, KillSwitch TP/FP/FN/TN as post-event attribution only, and append-only ledger persistence reuse existing contracts; capture adapters and productive host hooks are unchanged.\n- Safety correctness stays decision-time only and is not relabeled by later economic outcomes. No runtime wiring, execution permission, promotion, or core semantic change.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `tests/learning/test_deterministic_decision_outcome_evaluation_engine_v0.py`\n- [x] Existing DDO contract, control-plane, and capture tests\n- [x] Atlas validate + impact (`ATLAS_IMPACT=UPDATED`, `REVIEW_REQUIRED=0`)\n- [x] PR_BOUNDED_FULL selector target batch (914 passed, ~40s)\n\nMERGE_AUTHORIZED=false\nNO_ADMIN_BYPASS=true\nNO_AUTO_MERGE=true\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-01T18:46:50Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T18:57:04Z","closed_at":"2026-09-01T18:57:02Z","merged_at":"2026-09-01T18:57:02Z","merge_commit_sha":"2c67dd736216151b7bc1f70acaaff515e17b56ea","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"HrzFrnk","id":256250961,"node_id":"U_kgDOD0YUUQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256250961?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HrzFrnk","html_url":"https://github.com/HrzFrnk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HrzFrnk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HrzFrnk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HrzFrnk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HrzFrnk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HrzFrnk/subscriptions